	(text "Beacon: the MCU sends 38 kHz NEC frames (TIM1 PWM, ~1/3 duty), never a steady carrier:\nthe robot receivers (IRM-H638T) suppress continuous 38 kHz. Left and right strings can send\ndifferent codes. Gates are AC-coupled (100 nF / 100k, ~10 ms): a pin stuck high turns the LEDs off.\nMount the three LEDs of each string fanned out (TSAL6200 is +/-17 deg) to cover the room."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
